{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"MediaWiki REST revision HTML, sanitized","nodeCount":315,"content":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAQ"},"children":[{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]}]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAw"},"children":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBQ"},"children":[]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBw"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[]},"???"]},"\n"]},{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwCA"},"children":["\n\n\n"]},{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]},{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwCg"},"children":["\n\n"]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwDA"},"children":["\n",{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Wiki media omitted"]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"dl","props":{},"children":[{"type":"dd","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"i","props":{},"children":["GREETINGS PLAYER.",{"type":"br","props":{},"children":[]},"YOU HAVE PROVED YOURSELF QUITE SKILLFUL SO FAR...",{"type":"br","props":{},"children":[]},"BUT HOW SKILLFUL DO YOU THINK YOU ACTUALLY ARE?"]},{"type":"br","props":{},"children":[]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"dd","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["―"]},{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["???"]}," on Wave 41 of ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Fallen_Mode","title":"Fallen Mode"},"children":["Fallen"]}," mode (",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Hidden_Wave","title":"Hidden Wave"},"children":["Hidden Wave"]},")"]}]}]},"\n"]},"\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwDQ"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Description"},"children":["Description"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["???"]},", internally referred to as ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Unknown"]},", is the main narrator of the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Hidden_Wave","title":"Hidden Wave"},"children":["Hidden Wave"]},"."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["While its identity is not revealed in-game, it did appear in ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Failed_Gateway","title":"Failed Gateway"},"children":["Failed Gateway"]}," on the other side of the portal, sitting on a throne in the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Nil_Zone","title":"Nil Zone"},"children":["Nil Zone"]},". The exact character model was also called ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Lord_Exo","title":"Lord Exo"},"children":["Lord Exo"]}," by the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Narrator_(Narrator)","title":"Narrator (Narrator)"},"children":["Narrator"]}," in the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Lunar_Overture_Event","title":"Lunar Overture Event"},"children":["Lunar Overture Event"]},"'s scrapped final map cutscenes and in ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/The_Classic_Event","title":"The Classic Event"},"children":["The Classic Event"]},"'s trailer. Multiple maps also use the same appearance, such as a sign in ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Pier_Pressure","title":"Pier Pressure"},"children":["Pier Pressure"]},"."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwGg"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Appearance"},"children":["Appearance"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["???"]}," has a completely black body. Its torso is translucent, revealing its ribcage. It wears a black domino crown. While not that clear from just the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Hidden_Wave","title":"Hidden Wave"},"children":["Hidden Wave"]},", ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["???"]}," is actually a silhouette, as the original character actually has a purple torso."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwHw"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Trivia"},"children":["Trivia"]},"\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["The ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["???"]}," narrator uses a similar model as the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/1x1x1x1","title":"1x1x1x1"},"children":["1x1x1x1"]}," from ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/The_Classic_Event","title":"The Classic Event"},"children":["The Classic Event"]},", except that it has a completely black body and a different ribcage.\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["However, these two narrators are not the same character. Rather, ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["???"]}," is assumed to be ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Lord_Exo","title":"Lord Exo"},"children":["Lord Exo"]}," due to its similar characteristics with one of ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Lord_Exo","title":"Lord Exo"},"children":["Lord Exo's"]}," appearances (the model shown in ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Failed_Gateway","title":"Failed Gateway"},"children":["Failed Gateway"]},"), though this is not entirely confirmed."]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["Unlike other narrators, ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["???"]}," refers to the player as just ",{"type":"i","props":{},"children":["\"player\""]},".\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["While other characters do talk to the player or even mention in-game mechanics, they treat the player as a member of the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/T.D.S._Organization","title":"T.D.S. Organization"},"children":["T.D.S. Organization"]}," in most cases, with some exceptions like the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Refund_Center","title":"Refund Center"},"children":["Refund Center"]},"."]}]}]}]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwMg"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Update_History"},"children":["Update History"]},"\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["2 August 2024"]}," - ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/V1.27.0","title":"V1.27.0"},"children":["v1.27.0"]},"\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"